# A round, leafy garden tree: a stout trunk with a flared root and a big
# puffy crown of blobs, sunlit on top. Centre x = z = 11.
size 22 34 22
voxel 0.07
smooth 2
colors
  b bark
  l leaf
  h leafLight
ellipsoid 11 1 11 2.6 1.4 2.6 b
ellipsoid 11 6 11 1.8 6.5 1.8 b
ellipsoid 11 20 11 8.5 7.5 8.5 l
ellipsoid 6 17.5 8 5 4.5 5 l
ellipsoid 16 18 13.5 5 4.5 5 l
ellipsoid 13 17 6 4.5 4 4.5 l
ellipsoid 11 26 11 6 5 6 l
paint ellipsoid 9 28 9.5 6.5 3.4 6.5 h
paint ellipsoid 5 21 7 3.5 2 3.5 h
